This repository contains an ONNX conversion made by Drew Bednar for
go-phonmatchnet, from the PyTorch conversion
androiddrew/google-speech-embedding-pytorch (revision v1, commit
ad7a3dd93b02f83797a040857425d6343d98680a). It is not affiliated with or
endorsed by Google.

Modifications to the original work:
- the TensorFlow graph was re-implemented with PyTorch operations, then
  exported to ONNX;
- HWIO convolution kernels were transposed to OIHW;
- the original inference-time spatial-mean subtraction was applied to the
  first convolution kernel ahead of time;
- the FFT was expressed as a convolution with a fixed DFT basis, with the
  original window applied to it.
All trained parameters, normalization statistics and frontend constants are
otherwise unchanged. No training or fine-tuning was performed.

The original archive contained no NOTICE file.
